💜✨FUTURE HUSKY!!!✨💜

After a long recruiting process I am so excited to have found the school and program that’s right for me. College gymnastics has been my dream for so long and Washington is the definition of that dream coming true. I wouldn’t have achieved this without all the support I have received from my family, coaches and teammates. 

A huge thank you to my wonderful coaches @coach_armen_smg  and @coach_oksana_smg and to my future coaches @jessahandstand , @jlangenstein , @gymcoachg and @racheldavid14 who have been so welcoming. 

A final thanks to all of the other college coaches who took the time to get to know me over the past year and a half. I’m so excited for this next chapter. Go Dawgs!! 
