@uw_football commit Zaydrius Rainey-Sale is off to a great start this season, showing why he’s the top ranked high school football player in Washington! I pulled up to his game this past weekend and he was doing it all. He led the game in tackles and deflected multiple passes on defense, while also making the longest play of the game on offense!

Zaydrius also had a pick 6 called back on a flag that was quite confusing. I still don’t see where the penalty was when watching back on the footage, but that’s just how the game goes sometimes. He still helped lead Bethel to a 21-7 win, and balled out alongside his teammates 😮‍💨

Make sure to follow his journey and follow this page @inevitableathlete for the best highlights in the PNW 🙏

